{"seq":2,"slug":"origin-preference-query","title":"原产地与优惠税率查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/hs-code-tariff-classification/tariff-lookup/origin-preference-query","wordCount":2248,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"原产地与优惠税率查询\">原产地与优惠税率查询</h1><p>签了自贸协定不等于自动享受优惠。一件商品要拿到更低税率，必须证明它满足原产地规则、走的是合规的运输路径、并且能出示被进口国海关接受的证明。这三点任何一点不成立，税率就退回最惠国水平。本文讲怎么把「原产地资格」这件事从人工判断变成可计算的判定，以及它怎么接到税率查询上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-优惠资格的四个条件\">核心概念：优惠资格的四个条件</h2><p>协定优惠的适用是一个四段式判定，顺序不能乱。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，商品在协定的降税清单内。</strong> 协定不是全品类降税，很多协定有敏感产品清单，编码在清单内才有优惠。这一步用编码对协定的降税表做匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，满足原产地规则。</strong> 包括完全获得（WO，用于农产品、矿产品）与实质性改变（用于含进口成分的工业品）。实质性改变有三条判据路径，满足其一即可：<strong>税则归类改变（CTC）</strong>、<strong>区域价值成分（RVC）</strong>、<strong>特定加工工序</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，满足运输规则（直接运输）。</strong> 货物必须在中国与进口国之间直接运输，或经第三国转运但未在该国进入贸易或消费、且仅做必要的物流作业。经第三方中转但未满足条件会丧失优惠资格，这一点在跨境物流里经常发生。</p>\n<p><strong>第四，出示有效证明。</strong> 常见形态是原产地证书（如中国的 CO/form 类证书）或原产地声明（自我声明，部分协定允许经核准出口商自行出具）。电子化程度逐年提高，部分国家已支持电子原产地数据交换。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[商品扩展位编码] --&gt; B{在协定降税清单内}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[按 MFN 税率]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{满足原产地规则}&#10;    D --&gt;|完全获得 WO| E[合格]&#10;    D --&gt;|实质性改变| F{CTC / RVC / 工序}&#10;    F --&gt;|任一满足| E&#10;    F --&gt;|均不满足| C&#10;    E --&gt; G{满足直接运输}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| C&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H{有效证明}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| C&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[适用协定优惠税率]\">graph TD\n    A[商品扩展位编码] --&gt; B{在协定降税清单内}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[按 MFN 税率]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{满足原产地规则}\n    D --&gt;|完全获得 WO| E[合格]\n    D --&gt;|实质性改变| F{CTC / RVC / 工序}\n    F --&gt;|任一满足| E\n    F --&gt;|均不满足| C\n    E --&gt; G{满足直接运输}\n    G --&gt;|否| C\n    G --&gt;|是| H{有效证明}\n    H --&gt;|否| C\n    H --&gt;|是| I[适用协定优惠税率]</pre><h2 id=\"实质性改变的三条判据路径\">实质性改变的三条判据路径</h2><p>这是原产地计算的核心，也是最容易实现错的部分。三条路径是<strong>择一满足</strong>，不是全部满足。</p>\n<p>**税则归类改变（CTC）**要求加工后编码在前几位发生变化。常见形式有 CC（章改变）、CTH（品目改变）、CTSH（子目改变）。它的判定输入是「进口原料的编码」与「成品编码」，计算方式是编码前缀比对，看起来最直接，但前提是原料编码准确——原料归类错了，CTC 判定就跟着错。</p>\n<p>**区域价值成分（RVC）**按价值比例判定，公式一般形式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RVC = \\frac{V_{domestic}}{V_{total}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{domestic}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是区域内原产材料加本地增值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常是 FOB 价或成交价。注意<strong>不同协定对分子分母的定义不同</strong>，有的用「累积规则」允许把其他协定成员的材料计为原产，有的不允许；有的用扣减法（total − non-originating），有的用累加法。因此 <code>RVC</code> 不是一个可以跨协定复用的标量函数，它必须按协定参数化。</p>\n<p><strong>特定加工工序</strong>是按产品列出的工艺要求，例如「须经过织造工序」。它的判定依赖生产工序数据，这类数据在系统里往往最难获取，因此实务中常退化为「供应商声明 + 抽查」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>判定复杂度</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CTC</td>\n<td>原料编码 + 成品编码</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>原料归类错误传导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RVC</td>\n<td>成本结构 + 累积规则</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>分子分母定义按协定而异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工序</td>\n<td>生产工艺数据</td>\n<td>高（数据难获取）</td>\n<td>数据缺失导致退化为声明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RvcParams {&#10;  accumulation: boolean;&#10;  numerator: &#39;domestic_plus_value&#39; | &#39;build_up&#39; | &#39;build_down&#39;;&#10;  denominator: &#39;fob&#39; | &#39;transaction_value&#39;;&#10;  threshold: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface OriginInput {&#10;  finishedCode: string;&#10;  materials: { code: string; value: number; originating: boolean }[];&#10;  fobValue: number;&#10;  agreement: string;&#10;  params: RvcParams;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function rvcPercent(input: OriginInput): number {&#10;  const originating = input.materials.filter((m) =&gt; m.originating).reduce((a, m) =&gt; a + m.value, 0);&#10;  const total = input.params.denominator === &#39;fob&#39; ? input.fobValue : input.fobValue;&#10;  return total === 0 ? 0 : (originating / total) * 100;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RvcParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  accumulation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  numerator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'domestic_plus_value'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'build_up'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'build_down'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  denominator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fob'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'transaction_value'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OriginInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  finishedCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  materials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">originating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fobValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  agreement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RvcParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rvcPercent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OriginInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> originating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input.materials.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.originating).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.value, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> total</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input.params.denominator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fob'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input.fobValue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input.fobValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (originating </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段简化的实现里，真正会出错的是 <code>material.originating</code> 这个布尔值从哪来。它本身就是一个递归的原产地判定——上游供应商的材料也要满足原产地规则才能算原产。因此<strong>原产地判定本质是一次沿 BOM 向下递归的计算</strong>，并且在存在累积规则时需要跨协定的来源数据。工程上必须限定递归深度与数据可得性，并对「无法证明原产」的材料默认按非原产处理（保守假设），而不是乐观假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"直接运输与转运证据\">直接运输与转运证据</h2><p>直接运输规则的判定输入是物流轨迹。系统需要能回答：货物是否经过第三国、在第三国是否发生超出必要范围的操作。</p>\n<p><strong>必要操作</strong>通常包括转运、仓储、展示、拆并箱、以及维持货物良好状态所需的处理。<strong>禁止的操作</strong>包括进入第三国贸易或消费、进行实质性加工。</p>\n<p>工程上这条规则依赖物流单证的完整性。判定所需证据包括：全程提单/运单、中转地仓储记录、以及证明未进入贸易的声明。<strong>大多数系统在这一步做不到自动化</strong>，因为轨迹数据在货代系统里而不在自建系统里。可行的做法是把「转运是否影响原产地资格」做成一个必须人工确认的风险标记：当轨迹中出现未在协定覆盖内的中转地时，标记为待确认，并在未确认前不适用优惠税率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证明形态与电子化校验\">证明形态与电子化校验</h2><p>原产地证明的三种常见形态，校验方式差别很大。</p>\n<p><strong>官方签发证书</strong>（如各类 CO）有编号与签发机构，可通过签发机构或进口国海关的核验渠道验证。校验点包括证书编号、品名与编码一致性、签发日期早于装运日期、以及是否有涂改或作废标记。</p>\n<p><strong>经核准出口商的原产地声明</strong>由企业自行出具，依赖企业资质。校验点是出口商是否在核准名单内。</p>\n<p><strong>电子原产地数据交换</strong>在部分协定下已实现，进口方海关可直接获取原产地数据，无需纸质证书。这是趋势，但覆盖面与实时性因协定而异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证明形态</th>\n<th>出具方</th>\n<th>可自动校验点</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>官方证书</td>\n<td>签发机构</td>\n<td>编号、日期、品名与编码一致性</td>\n<td>纸质伪造、涂改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经核准出口商声明</td>\n<td>出口企业</td>\n<td>企业资质名单</td>\n<td>企业超范围出具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电子数据交换</td>\n<td>双方海关</td>\n<td>全字段可校验</td>\n<td>覆盖面有限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>一个必须建立的校验是时间一致性</strong>：证明的签发日期不得晚于装运日期，且必须在协定规定的有效期内。系统里最容易出的错是「先装运后补证」的单据被自动接受，这在海关审核时会被直接否掉优惠资格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接到税率查询上-优惠资格作为求值条件\">接到税率查询上：优惠资格作为求值条件</h2><p>优惠税率不是税率库里的一条独立记录，而是税率求值的一个分支。接入方式是：税率求值接口接受一个可选的 <code>preferenceClaim</code>，其内容为原产地资格判定结果与证明信息；当 <code>preferenceClaim</code> 通过时，求值走协定优惠分支，否则走 MFN。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PreferenceClaim {&#10;  agreement: string;&#10;  originCountry: string;&#10;  criterion: &#39;WO&#39; | &#39;CTC&#39; | &#39;RVC&#39; | &#39;PROCESS&#39;;&#10;  certificateType: &#39;official&#39; | &#39;self_declaration&#39; | &#39;electronic&#39;;&#10;  certificateRef: string;&#10;  directShipmentVerified: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TariffQueryWithClaim {&#10;  territory: string;&#10;  code: string;&#10;  asOf: string;&#10;  claim?: PreferenceClaim;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PreferenceClaim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  agreement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  originCountry</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  criterion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'WO'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CTC'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RVC'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PROCESS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  certificateType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'official'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'self_declaration'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'electronic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  certificateRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  directShipmentVerified</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TariffQueryWithClaim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  territory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  asOf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  claim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PreferenceClaim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条接口设计约束。<strong>其一，<code>claim</code> 是可选而非必填</strong>，因为下游经常只想查 MFN 税率做成本预估。<strong>其二，优惠资格的判定结果必须与税率一起返回</strong>，包含命中的判据（CTC/RVC/工序）与依据参数，这样在争议时能回答「为什么给了优惠」或「为什么没给」。<strong>其三，优惠资格不通过时必须显式返回不通过的原因编码</strong>（清单外、原产地不满足、运输不满足、证明无效），而不是静默返回 MFN 税率——静默降级会让下游无法区分「本来就该交 MFN」与「优惠申请有问题」。</p>\n<p>优惠资格被否的争议处理属于海关质疑的范畴，见 <a href=\"../review-audit/customs-dispute-reclass\">海关质疑与改类处理</a>；而优惠判定所需的编码与税率版本时点，与 <a href=\"../tariff-lookup/tariff-rate-database\">税率/协定优惠税率库</a> 共用同一套版本化机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>协定优惠适用是四段式判定：清单内 → 原产地规则 → 直接运输 → 有效证明；顺序不可乱，任一不满足即回退 MFN。</li>\n<li>实质性改变三条路径（CTC / RVC / 工序）择一满足；RVC 的分子分母定义按协定参数化，不可跨协定复用。</li>\n<li>原产地判定本质是沿 BOM 的递归计算；无法证明原产的材料须保守按非原产处理，并需考虑累积规则。</li>\n<li>直接运输依赖物流轨迹，多数系统只能做到风险标记 + 人工确认，不能自动化时不要假装自动化。</li>\n<li>证明校验必须包含时间一致性（签发日期不晚于装运日期）与出具方资质。</li>\n<li>优惠资格应作为税率求值的分支条件接入；不通过时必须返回原因编码，禁止静默降级为 MFN。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原产地与优惠税率查询","id":"原产地与优惠税率查询"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：优惠资格的四个条件","id":"核心概念-优惠资格的四个条件"},{"level":2,"text":"实质性改变的三条判据路径","id":"实质性改变的三条判据路径"},{"level":2,"text":"直接运输与转运证据","id":"直接运输与转运证据"},{"level":2,"text":"证明形态与电子化校验","id":"证明形态与电子化校验"},{"level":2,"text":"接到税率查询上：优惠资格作为求值条件","id":"接到税率查询上-优惠资格作为求值条件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"税率/协定优惠税率库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/hs-code-tariff-classification/tariff-lookup/tariff-rate-database"},"next":{"title":"归类/税率查询 API 给上下游","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/hs-code-tariff-classification/tariff-lookup/classification-api"}}